ough lane 1 (blue)\n* Other passengers board through lane 2 (green)\n* Staggered boarding call with groups 1-5\n* Push notifications for passengers with the airline's mobile app\n\n**Expanded Routes in Latin America:**\n\n* Joint business agreement (JBA) with Copa and Avianca\n* More choices for customers, including new nonstop routes and additional flights\n* Reduced travel times and economic benefits for consumers and communities\n\n**Customer Feedback:**\n\n* United has listened to customer feedback and implemented changes to improve the boarding process\n* The new boarding process aims to reduce congestion and speed up the boarding process\n\nOverall, United's new boarding process and expanded routes in Latin America are designed",
